---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="A live chorus of eastern banjo frogs (pobblebonks), synthesised in your browser." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1210" />
    <title>Hold My Banjo</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,700;0,9..144,900;1,9..144,400&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="hero">
      <img src="/banjo-frog.jpg" alt="An eastern banjo frog sitting on moss at night" width="1600" height="830" />
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>Hold My Banjo</h1>
        <p class="tagline">A live chorus of pobblebonks, synthesised in your browser</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <p class="intro">
        A live, in-browser chorus of eastern banjo frogs (pobblebonk, <em>Limnodynastes dumerilii</em>). Each frog calls
        on its own jittered rhythm; the coupled modes make frogs react to calls from their neighbours and are
        <strong>hypothetical</strong>, borrowed from Japanese tree frog models rather than measured banjo frog behaviour.
      </p>

      <form id="controls">
        <fieldset id="chorus">
          <legend>Chorus</legend>
          <p class="hint">How many frogs are at the pond and how they listen to each other.</p>
          <div class="grid">
            <label>
              <span>Frogs</span>
              <output id="frogs-out">8</output>
              <input type="range" id="frogs" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="8" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Seed</span>
              <input type="number" id="seed" value="42017" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Mode</span>
              <select id="mode">
                <option value="0">Independent</option>
                <option value="1">Event delay</option>
                <option value="2">Event advance</option>
                <option value="3">Phase coupled</option>
              </select>
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Coupling strength</span>
              <output id="strength-out">0</output>
              <input type="range" id="strength" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Mean interval (s)</span>
              <output id="interval-out">3</output>
              <input type="range" id="interval" min="0.8" max="8" step="0.1" value="3" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Hearing radius (m)</span>
              <output id="radius-out">15</output>
              <input type="range" id="radius" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="15" />
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset id="bonk">
          <legend>Bonk</legend>
          <p class="hint">The shape of a single call. Moving a slider auditions it.</p>
          <div class="grid">
            <label>
              <span>Pitch (Hz)</span>
              <output id="bonk-pitch-out">440</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-pitch" min="100" max="1500" step="1" value="440" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Spread (Hz)</span>
              <output id="bonk-spread-out">40</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-spread" min="0" max="200" step="1" value="40" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Duration (s)</span>
              <output id="bonk-duration-out">0.25</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-duration" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.25" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Attack (s)</span>
              <output id="bonk-attack-out">0.002</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-attack" min="0.0005" max="0.1" step="0.0005" value="0.002" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Decay (s)</span>
              <output id="bonk-decay-out">0.06</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-decay" min="0.005" max="1" step="0.005" value="0.06" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Sweep depth</span>
              <output id="bonk-sweep-out">0.15</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-sweep" min="-0.5" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.15" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>Sweep time (s)</span>
              <output id="bonk-sweep-s-out">0.02</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-sweep-s" min="0.001" max="0.2" step="0.001" value="0.02" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>2nd harmonic</span>
              <output id="bonk-h2-out">0.35</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-h2" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.35" />
            </label>
            <label>
              <span>3rd harmonic</span>
              <output id="bonk-h3-out">0.1</output>
              <input type="range" id="bonk-h3" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.1" />
            </label>
          </div>
          <figure>
            <canvas id="bonk-wave" width="900" height="120"></canvas>
            <figcaption>One bonk, amplitude over time</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="actions">
            <button id="audition" type="button">Audition</button>
            <button id="bonk-reset" type="button">Reset bonk</button>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </form>

      <section class="stage">
        <div class="stage-head">
          <h2>The pond</h2>
          <div class="stage-actions">
            <button id="share" type="button">Spread the bonk</button>
            <button id="play" type="button" class="primary">Play</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure>
          <canvas id="scene" width="900" height="600"></canvas>
          <figcaption>Top-down view. Each dot is a frog and lights up when it calls; the half-dot at the bottom is you.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <canvas id="wave" width="900" height="120"></canvas>
          <figcaption>What you hear</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="compare">
        <h2>Real chorus for comparison</h2>
        <p>A field recording of actual banjo frogs. See how close the synth gets.</p>
        <audio controls preload="none" src="/banjo-frogs-long.m4a"></audio>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a href="https://github.com/kirhgoff/hold-my-banjo">Source on GitHub</a>
      <span>Rust · WebAssembly · AudioWorklet</span>
      <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eastern_Banjo_Frog_(Limnodynastes_dumerili)_(8398132352).jpg">Photo: Matt from Melbourne, CC BY 2.0</a>
    </footer>

    <script>
      import { init } from '../chorus';
      init();
    </script>

    <style>
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        margin: -1rem -1rem 2rem;
        min-height: min(70vh, 34rem);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius) var(--radius);
      }

      .hero img {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: 40% 55%;
      }

      .hero::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--bg) 0%, rgba(12, 18, 16, 0.6) 40%, rgba(12, 18, 16, 0) 75%);
      }

      .hero-text {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        padding: 0 1.5rem 2rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-weight: 900;
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 11vw, 6.5rem);
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--text);
        text-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      }

      .tagline {
        margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
        font-family: var(--display);
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vw, 1.5rem);
        color: var(--accent);
        text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      }

      .intro {
        max-width: 46rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      #controls {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.25rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }

      .hint {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
      }

      #bonk figure {
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
      }

      .actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .stage {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
      }

      .stage-head {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .stage-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .stage figure + figure {
        margin-top: 1rem;
      }

      .compare {
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
      }

      .compare p {
        margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      footer {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        padding: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        font-family: var(--mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
